OL,3,GNEWSAHillwalker found dead on Highland
OL,4,Amountain An Teallach
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hillwalker has died while on a
OL,7,Fmountain in Wester Ross, police have
OL,8,Fconfirmed.
OL,10,FConcerns were raised for the man on
OL,11,FMonday 10 August and his body was later
OL,12,Ffound and recovered from the An
OL,13,FTeallach area.
OL,15,FDundonnell and Police Scotland mountain
OL,16,Frescue teams carried out a search for
OL,17,Fthe walker.
OL,19,FAn Teallach is a mountain group south
OL,20,Fof Dundonnell, in the north west
OL,21,FHighlands, which is popular with
OL,22,Fwalkers and climbers.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
